  state: {burstAt: 1.2, burstFx: "fx\npop mote burst=40 on=disc(.6) life=1.5..2.5 v=up(.6..1.4)+sdir()*.4 size=.04..0.08 acc=curl(.5)+drag(.6) col=hdr(3,2.2,.7)>hdr(1.2,2.4,.8) a=0>.1:1>0 r=sprite(soft-disc,add)\npop glow burst=1 life=1.6 r=light(<1,.8,.4>,10*(1>0),10)", gain: Archive opened, mark: archive_opened, quest: BRD-09, say: "The round door rolls aside on roots that move like hands. Shelves of grown wood run back into the hill, every leaf a page.", title: the Root Archive door, verb: Open}
